        readiness probe
    repoConfig : MellanoxComV1alpha1NicClusterPolicySpecOfedDriverRepoConfig, default is Undefined, optional
        repo config
    repository : str, default is Undefined, optional
        Address of the registry that stores the image
    startupProbe : MellanoxComV1alpha1NicClusterPolicySpecOfedDriverStartupProbe, default is Undefined, optional
        startup probe
    terminationGracePeriodSeconds : int, default is 300, optional
        TerminationGracePeriodSeconds specifies the length of time in seconds
